{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review attestation earned: PASS, 0 blocking, certified at head_sha 28a6d8a82b54f826d9fca8c80c7b06daaac5d1e9 (currency_basis file_impact).\n\nWhy it was needed: change 2549 (the AC6 runbook) drew an `LLM-Review -1` whose sole blocking finding was `bugfix-size-attestation` — the change touches 232 non-test lines, over the 150-line floor for a bug fix, and this ticket had NO plan-review attestation (verdict: unsigned). The ticket had been carried in_progress at plan_review_phase=execution without one. Earning the attestation is the sanctioned remedy; agents must not --force past this gate. Patch set 2 of 2549 is pushed to re-trigger review now that the attestation exists.\n\nBefore spending the gate run I corrected AC2, since the preceding comment had already established its premise was false. AC2 now states what the fix demonstrably buys — the alarm re-enters ALARM at ~01:55:10 PDT on missing data rather than staying OK through the outage, versus never under the old configuration — and the rewrite is marked inline with its reason.\n\nOne advisory from the gate is worth surfacing because it independently identified the open decision I escalated to the operator: E2 on AC5 — 'AC5 offers either completed or explicitly superseded without stating a default, leaving a real choice (finish scowlful-bovine-dragonfly vs fold it into this ticket) to the executor.' That is exactly the scoping call I declined to make unilaterally. It remains open, alongside the larger question of whether alert fatigue — 11 delivered pages in 24h with no action — becomes its own tracked work item rather than being absorbed into the bounded-ceiling epic.\n\nThe second advisory (P6, acceptance-criteria/definition-of-done quality) is non-blocking and is not being actioned in this pass."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788401977835522001,"uuid":"71ce8a87-2d9f-42b6-a861-30e6256cd13b"}